{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>The sense of \"from that land went out Asshur.\"</b> He is the son of Japheth, and this was after the division. The king who first ruled over Babel was Nimrod. The author of Seder Olam explained that in his days the earth was divided — he being king over the seventy."], :book :genesis, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"] ["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:44:02.942749742Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}